	(text "Support, clock, reset and probe circuitry on the next sheet.\nGlobal labels connect sheets; named *_ISO nets are separate\nconductors on opposite sides of a powered-off-safe boundary.\nFirmware and hardware qualification remain with the team."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 248.92 109.22 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3f2a86da-d5f3-56af-acc4-73b3513d2d81")
	)
	(text "Allocation: the 100-pad map as amended by the capture specification, 21 Nov 2026\n(D-2Nov.1, D-2Nov.11, D-2Nov.18, D-5Nov.3, D-7.2, D-19Nov.2, D-19Nov.3).\nPin names and directions: docs/firmware-interface.md.\nADC_ labels are scaled physical inputs, never raw battery rails.\nVCAP pins share their own node; never tied to 3.3 V.\nVBAT is the backup-domain pin: FLIGHT_VBAT, from FLIGHT_3V3 through a Schottky\nwith 100 uF hold-up on 02a (D-6.4).\nSWD and oscillator nets are distinct for each processor."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 248.92 68.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "909639ea-44ee-56c9-805a-09450ca43b20")
	)
	(text "What this does: Runs flight sensing, estimation, mission decisions, recording, outputs and both vehicle CAN buses.\nConnects to: Sensor/storage sheets 03*, outputs 06*, CAN 05, monitoring 07*/08, comms link 04b and the power hold on 01-power. Supplies/clocks/test pads: 02a. Reset/debug: 02flight-reset-debug."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 27.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a237af9b-0e5d-546a-81f0-a38176176211")
	)
	(text "FLIGHT MCU / STM32H563VIT6 / NON-Q LQFP100"
